#: ../../source/docs/px4fmu-only-wiring.rst:151
#: 0bb5a123389d4e7c9f023ffefc368e01
msgid "Using a Standard RC Radio Receiver with an 8 channel PPM Encoder"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/px4fmu-only-wiring.rst:154
#: 96facc68c2084f59908a1797077c06ce
msgid "**You can use a standard radio receiver with an 8 channel PPM Encoder in place of the PPM-SUM receiver.**"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/px4fmu-only-wiring.rst:157
#: 3f1723d57cb34386a594d9dd23ba5cd3
msgid "An 8 Channel PPM Encoder is available from `jDrones here <http://store.jdrones.com/pixhawk_px4_paparazzi_ppm_encoder_v2_p/eleppmenc20.htm>`__."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/px4fmu-only-wiring.rst:159
#: ca6cd5d540864b6ea706334b8f93ab28
msgid "Solder a 3x8 Right angle connector from the top into one end of the 8 Channel PPM Encoder board."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/px4fmu-only-wiring.rst:161
#: dbe98ef1bd2840d6bb45f7205ba75a9b
msgid "With the 3x8 connector up and facing away from you, solder a 3x1 Right angle connector on the right edge of the 8 Channel PPM Encoder board."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/px4fmu-only-wiring.rst:165
#: 9924c89ae89a4721b3cb02529a5c2e86
msgid "**Connect 5-8 output channels of your receiver to the inputs of the 8 Channel Encoder (signal wire furthest from board) with 5-8 female to female servo jumpers.**"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/px4fmu-only-wiring.rst:169
#: ed4ea98677e74f5db54b3fcfac6faf6d
msgid "Connect the PPM-SUM signal output of the Encoder to the PX4FMU boards PPM sum signal input (Pin 6 of the 15 pin Multi connector)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/px4fmu-only-wiring.rst:171
#: 8100783fd7c549e4b9adfe10367428a5
msgid "Connect the PPM-SUM ground input of the Encoder to the PX4FMU boards ground connection (Pin 1 of the 15 pin Multi connector)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/px4fmu-only-wiring.rst:173
#: aa50c7723bd34ca4825161d58821a14f
msgid "Connect the PPM-SUM power input of the Encoder to the PX4FMU boards power connection (Pin 15 of the 15 pin Multi connector)."
msgstr ""

